er elhandelsföretagen har rapporterat in till Energimarknadsinspektionen (Ei)."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XLSX"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-01-29T13:15:09+01:00"}},{"@id":"https://ei.entryscape.net/store/1/resource/9","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://ei.entryscape.net/store/1/resource/11"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://ei.entryscape.net/store/1/resource/16"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity prices"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Energy"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"El"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elhandel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elpriser"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Energi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Jämförpriser"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://www.ei.se/sv/statistik/"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Average comparable electricity price per kWh for household customers 2008-2017. Depending on what contract they have, how much electricity they consume and what bidding area they live in. The statistics are based on the data that the electricity suppliers submit to the Energy Markets Inspectorate (Ei)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genomsnittliga jämförpriser för elen per kWh för hushållskunder under 2008-2017. Beroende på vad de har för avtal, hur mycket el de förbrukar och vilket elområde de bor i. Statistiken baseras på de uppgifter elhandelsföretagen har rapporterat in till Energimarknadsinspektionen (Ei)."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005695"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}